# Logging

## Choose the right channel

| Situation | Use |
| --- | --- |
| Unexpected failure in runtime code | `console.error` / `console.warn` with a short prefix |
| User-visible issue | `app.toast.create` (see `error-handling.mdc`) — not console-only |
| Action execution history | Core `ActionLogService` / `core.logs` → `logs/actions.ndjson` |

## Do not

- Invent a parallel log file format or logger package.
- Leave debug `console.log` in shipping paths (handlers, timers, WebSocket loops).
- Log secrets, tokens, or full OAuth URLs.

## Handler chain

Thrown handlers are already logged in `run-handler-chain.ts` (`Handler execution failed`). Prefer soft-fail + toast for expected errors so you don’t double-noise the console.
